WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Mythical Void. A father-and-son experiment became a real game.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Wanderer-77 is down. Recover what survived. Follow the signal.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Something survived with you. Hatch a strange creature and begin Project Beacon.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Authentic gameplay: run, leap and follow the signal through the Mythical Forest.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Strange forms. Unexpected traits.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Explore six living realms: Mythical Forest, Crystal Caves, Cosmic Reef, Void Peaks, Aurora Depths and Final Void.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Restore a world. Build a home.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Optional, credited NASA discoveries connect fantasy to real science. NASA does not endorse Mythical Void.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Made in Ireland. AI helps us build. People remain responsible.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Play free at mythicalvoid.com. No download or account needed to begin.
